<p>Lay a trap that releases a burst of antimagic energies (radius 2), draining up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">181, 212, 236, 257, 275</acronym> mana, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">90, 106, 118, 128, 137</acronym> vim, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">45, 53, 59, 64, 68</acronym> positive and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">45, 53, 59, 64, 68</acronym> negative energies from affected targets, while inflicting up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">181, 213, 237, 257, 275</acronym> arcane damage based on the resources drained, silencing for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns, and removing up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> beneficial magical effects or sustains.</p><p>The draining effect scales with your Willpower, and you must have 25 Willpower to prepare this trap.</p><p>This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.</p>